  "notes": "The wikitable is a three-rung UPGRADE chain, not a step list: Rolanberry -> 881 -> 874 -> 864, each rung traded to a basket to pop an NM that drops the next berry. Rungs two and three are optional -- the quest completes with any crawler-dropped berry, they only raise the gil -- so they are marked optional and can never be a ladder position, which is what stops a player who stops at 881 from being stuck. The baskets are named nowhere on the page, so their steps carry no target rather than a guessed one; the four crawler NMs ARE named and carry the markers instead. The turn-in takes any one of the three upgraded berries, which items_alt now says outright.",
