  "notes": "Quest id ZERO -- worth watching through the emitter and the Lua merge, because 0 is falsy in Lua and a truthiness test anywhere on the id would drop this quest silently. The eight mandatory NPCs are an unordered set and share a group, so all eight draw at once; walking them one at a time would mark Bondada and nothing else. What the addon cannot see is the COUNT: below 20 NPCs there is no credit at all and nothing in any packet reports how many you have shown the hat to, so the ladder can never advance past step 1 and the quest never claims to be ready. That is the honest answer for this quest. The whole walkthrough is a bulleted list inside a wikitable, so every step reports source_bullet 1.",
